  "description": "Se-Yun Jung, a 20-year-old rabbit beastfolk, starts college while facing pressure from her family to marry the last dragon beastfolk so they produce offspring. Driven by love, she rejects the push from her mother and vows to find love at university. She soon falls for a senior fox beastfolk while a mysterious senior snake beastfolk keeps appearing whenever she tries to get close to her fox-love.\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
